<div>
  <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
  <p>Hello,</p>
  <p>You recently requested to reset your password. Click the button below to
    proceed:</p>

  <a
    href='{{domain}}/reset-password?token={{resetToken}}'
    class='button'
    style='display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; color:white; background:#007bff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:5px;'
  >
    Reset Password
  </a>

  <p>If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

  <div class='footer'>
    <p>Thank you, <br /> NK:)</p>
  </div>
</div>